  "courseDescription": "This course covers the most important algorithm strategies and solution techniques,\nindependent of programming language or computer hardware. Topics include: Big-O notation;\nworst and average case analysis; recurrences and asymptotics; efficient algorithms for sorting,\nsearching, and selection; algorithm design techniques: divide-and-conquer, dynamic\nprogramming, greedy algorithms, randomization; algorithms for fundamental graph problems;\nstring algorithms; and numerical methods.",
